OL,3,GNEWSAFamilies encouraged by funeral
OL,4,Aregulation talks
OL,5,
OL,6,FFamilies affected by the crimes of
OL,7,Ffuneral director Robert Bush said they
OL,8,Fwere encouraged after meeting
OL,9,FDepartment of Health officials working
OL,10,Fon plans to regulate the funeral
OL,11,Findustry.
OL,13,FSome 35 bodies and more than 100 sets
OL,14,Fof ashes were found by police who
OL,15,Fraided Legacy Independent Funeral
OL,16,FDirectors in Hull in March 2024.
OL,18,FBush was jailed for 20 years in July
OL,19,Fafter pleading guilty to 67 offences,
OL,20,Fincluding keeping 30 bodies after their
OL,21,Ffunerals and presenting families with
OL,22,Fthe ashes of strangers.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,385,380,200,160,0,100
