OL,3,GNEWSAFamilies encouraged by funeral
OL,4,Aregulation talks
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham previously
OL,7,Fsaid he was committed to "bringing
OL,8,Fforward proposals for the regulation of
OL,9,Fthe funeral service" after being
OL,10,F"shocked to my core" by the case.
